{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53845","headline":"春寒夜宿先天寺无可上人房 · 喻凫","name":"春寒夜宿先天寺无可上人房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双扉桧下开，寄宿石莓苔。\n{墙左爲阝}北香风动，城寒散雪来。\n收棋想云梦，罢茗议天台。\n同忆前年腊，师初白阁回。\n（见《四库珍本初集》本宋李庚《天台前集》卷七）（按：《全唐诗》卷六四九收此诗爲方干作，文字略异。\n今考方干年辈晚於无可，喻凫则与无可年次相当。\n据诗意，似以喻作爲近是。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"喻凫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53845.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53845","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}